<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭpĕr-indūco</span></b> ,
			xi, ctum, 3, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>to draw over</i>, <i>cover over</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					5, 8, 2</span></i>
			
			<i>N. cr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 17, 18, § 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabellas cerā delitā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just. 2, 10, 14</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To cause to come upon</i>, <i>to bring
				upon</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eis principes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					2 Par. 33, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in nos magnum malum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Dan. 9, 12</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to mention
			afterwards</i>, <i>to add</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dispositionem caeli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Herm. 26</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
